            "Unnamed: 3": "text",
            "Unnamed: 4": 2,
            "Unnamed: 5": "No",
            "Unnamed: 6": NaN,
            "Unnamed: 7": 20,
            "Unnamed: 8": NaN,
            "Unnamed: 9": NaN,
            "Unnamed: 10": "RPREASND [en]",
            "Unnamed: 11": "RPREASND [CDASH]\nProvide the reason the measurement or test was not done. [completionInstructions]\nThe reason the data are not available may be chosen from a sponsor-defined list (e.g., broken equipment, subject refused) or entered as free text. When PCREASND is used, the SDTMIG variable PCSTAT should also be populated in the SDTM-based dataset. [implementationNotes]\nMaps directly to the SDTMIG variable listed in the column with the heading SDTMIG Target. [mappingInstructions]\nReason Not Done [prompt]",
