            "Unnamed: 9": NaN,
            "Unnamed: 10": "RPDAT [en]",
            "Unnamed: 11": "RPDAT [CDASH]\nRecord date of collection using this format (DD-MON-YYYY). [completionInstructions]\nThis should be a complete date. The date of collection may be determined from the date of visit (VISDAT). [implementationNotes]\nThis does not map directly to an SDTMIG variable. For the SDTM submission dataset, concatenate all collected CDASH DATE and TIME components and populate the SDTMIG variable RPDTC in ISO 8601 format. [mappingInstructions]\nCollection Date [prompt]",
